('ic_1.15', 'ic', '1.15', 'I hold myself accountable by...', 'Setting self-directed development objectives in line with my career path.', 'Growth Proactivity', 'Consistently producing thorough, error-free deliverables.', 'High-Quality Delivery'),
('manager_2.1', 'manager', '2.1', 'When the team faces a complex roadblock, my instinct is to...', 'Ask open-ended questions to help them figure out the solution.', 'Development Coaching', 'Re-distribute responsibilities to sustain peak energy.', 'Workload Balancing'),
