('manager_2.6', 'manager', '2.6', 'As a manager, I deliver the most value by...', 'Providing timely, growth-oriented performance reviews.', 'Actionable Feedback', 'Investing resources prudently in high-leverage tools.', 'Resource Stewardship'),
('manager_2.7', 'manager', '2.7', 'When project priorities clash, I tend to...', 'Invest resources prudently to address the gap.', 'Resource Stewardship', 'Facilitate open dialogue to ensure mutual understanding.', 'Neutral Mediation'),
