('manager_2.13', 'manager', '2.13', 'The hallmark of a healthy team culture is...', 'Durable commitments to shared team working agreements.', 'Norms Alignment', 'Productive standups and syncs that sustain steady velocity.', 'Execution Cadence'),
('manager_2.14', 'manager', '2.14', 'To ensure daily operations run smoothly, I...', 'Run productive reviews that sustain steady velocity.', 'Execution Cadence', 'Ensure all voices are actively considered in team decisions.', 'Inclusive Decisions'),
